      "id": "epic",
      "kind": "epic",
      "title": "Boilerplate Microservice + Micro-frontend",
      "summary": "Template nội bộ copy-able: mixed-stack services (Node/Spring/Go) + Module Federation FE, demo e2e task management qua nginx gateway, Docker Compose + CI. Spec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-12-boilerplate-microservice-mfe.md rev 3."
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-1",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "Contracts & Platform Foundation",
      "tier": 0,
      "summary": "Phase 1/3 — shippable: nền tảng. OpenAPI specs + canonical tasks DDL + users fixture + token contract; conventions (healthcheck, JSON log, error envelope, port table, CORS dev); compose PRE-SEED đủ khung 6 services + postgres init (readonly grants qua default privileges); nginx gateway; auth-mock; fe-shared kèm spike MF/Rspack pin versions; CI templates (path-filter + boot-smoke + gitleaks). Demo: swagger auth-mock login nhận JWT hợp lệ; CI contract lint xanh. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-1.md",
      "linear": "FI-64"
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-2",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "node-svc — task API (Fastify + TS)",
      "tier": 1,
      "summary": "Phase 1/3 — shippable: task CRUD qua gateway, user validate qua spring (timeout 2s, fail-closed 503), event push fire-and-forget sang go-svc, migration khớp canonical DDL, boot-smoke CI. Demo: swagger tạo/list task. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-2.md",
      "linear": "FI-70"
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-3",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "spring-svc — user API (Spring Boot 3)",
      "tier": 1,
      "summary": "Phase 1/3 — shippable: users + teams CRUD, seed đọc users fixture (id khớp 100%), JWT service-side verify, Flyway migration, mvnw wrapper, boot-smoke CI. Demo: swagger GET fixture user. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-3.md",
      "linear": "FI-71"
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-4",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "go-svc — activity API (Go 1.24 + chi)",
      "tier": 1,
      "summary": "Phase 1/3 — shippable: nhận POST /activity/events, feed + stats (đọc readonly schema tasks theo canonical DDL), tự migrate schema activity, readonly-read exit criterion (seed qua owner role), boot-smoke CI. Demo: swagger-ui POST event → feed. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-4.md",
      "linear": "FI-72"
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-5",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "FE shell — MF host (Rspack)",
      "tier": 1,
      "summary": "Phase 2/3 — shippable: shell login mock JWT, nav + routing, load remotes theo registry, error boundary remote-down, a11y baseline có test (route focus + skip link). Task đầu: re-validation spike SF-1 + fe-shared fit-check. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-5.md",
      "linear": "FI-73"
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-6",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "FE remotes — tasks + activity",
      "tier": 2,
      "summary": "Phase 2/3 — shippable: 2 remote gọi service thật qua gateway (tạo task qua node-svc; feed/stats qua go-svc), shared singletons theo catalog, boot-smoke per remote (remoteEntry fetch được). Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-6.md",
      "linear": "FI-74"
    },
    {
      "id": "sf-7",
      "kind": "sf",
      "title": "Convergence & Scaffold",
      "tier": 3,
      "summary": "Phase 3/3 — shippable: e2e smoke script committed + CI job (login → tạo task → đọc feed qua gateway), copy-dir standalone smoke, health-gated compose, docs + ADR + fresh-clone walkthrough, scaffold script (trễ = scope-flag, không auto-complete), security-audit checkpoint. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/sf-7.md",
      "linear": "FI-75"
    }
